?><!doctype html><html lang="uz"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Onlayn to‘lov — Algoritm</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css?v=8"><style>.pay-wrap{max-width:760px;margin:55px auto;padding:24px}.pay-card{background:#121216;border:1px solid #342027;border-radius:20px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 15px 45px #e5091410;color:#f6f6f8}.pay-card h1{font:800 30px Manrope,sans-serif;margin:6px 0 10px}.pay-card label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:16px;color:#c9c9d0}.pay-card input,.pay-card select{width:100%;padding:13px;margin-top:7px;border:1px solid #393940;border-radius:9px;background:#08080a;color:#fff}.pay-notice{padding:13px 15px;background:#1c171a;color:#e2c8cc;border:1px solid #422028;border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:18px 0}.price-box{background:#1b1b21;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-top:16px;font-weight:700}.back{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;color:#ff4b59;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}</style></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="index.php"><img class="brand-logo" src="assets/images/algoritm-logo.jpeg" alt="Algoritm"><span>ALGORITM<small>O‘quv markazi</small></span></a><nav><a href="index.php#kurslar">Kurslar</a><a href="index.php#royxat">Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish</a><a class="nav-cta" href="admin/login.php">Administrator</a></nav></header><main class="pay-wrap"><section class="pay-card"><span class="eyebrow">QULAY TO‘LOV</span><h1>O‘qish uchun to‘lov</h1><p class="form-intro">Ma’lumotlaringizni kiriting va to‘lov so‘rovini yarating.</p><?php if($created): ?><div class="alert success">To‘lov so‘rovingiz qabul qilindi. Hozircha Click/Payme kabi to‘lov provayderi ulanmagan, shu sababli bu sahifada karta orqali pul yechilmaydi. Administrator to‘lovni tasdiqlash uchun siz bilan bog‘lanadi.</div><?php endif; ?><?php if($error): ?><div class="alert error"><?= $error==='invalid'?'Ma’lumotlarni tekshirib, qayta yuboring.':($error==='db'?'Bazaga ulanishda xatolik.':'So‘rov yuborilmadi. Qayta urinib ko‘ring.') ?></div><?php endif; ?><form method="post" action="create_payment.php" enctype="multipart/form-data"><label>Ism va familiya<input name="full_name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Ali Valiyev"></label><label>Telefon raqami<input name="phone" required maxlength="25" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+998 90 123 45 67"></label><label>Kursni tanlang<select name="course_id" id="courseSelect" required><option value="">Kursni tanlang</option><?php foreach($courses as $c): ?><option value="<?= (int)$c['id'] ?>" <?= $selectedCourse===(int)$c['id']?'selected':'' ?> data-price="<?= htmlspecialchars((string)$c['price']) ?>"><?= htmlspecialchars($c['name']) ?> — <?= number_format((float)$c['price'],0,'.',' ') ?> so‘m</option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><div class="price-box">Kurs narxi: <span id="priceText">—</span></div><label>To‘lov yo‘lini tanlang<select name="provider" id="providerSelect" required><option value="click">Click orqali o‘tkazma</option><option value="payme">Payme orqali o‘tkazma</option><option value="bank">Oddiy bank o‘tkazmasi</option></select></label><div class="pay-notice" id="cardInfo"><strong>To‘lov kartasi:</strong><div id="cardNumber"></div><div id="cardHolder"></div><small>Bu karta ma’lumoti orqali qo‘lda pul o‘tkaziladi. Sayt Click/Payme tizimiga avtomatik ulanmagan.</small></div><label>To‘lov qilgan kartangizning oxirgi 4 raqami (ixtiyoriy)<input name="payer_card_last4" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" placeholder="1234"></label><label>To‘lov cheki (JPG, PNG yoki PDF)<input type="file" name="receipt" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf" required></label><div class="pay-notice"><strong>To‘lov tartibi:</strong> yuqorida ko‘rsatilgan administrator kartalaridan biriga bank ilovangiz orqali pul o‘tkazing va chekni yuklang. Sayt karta ma’lumotlaringizni yig‘maydi. Administrator pul tushganini tekshirib, to‘lovni tasdiqlaydi.</div><button class="button primary full" type="submit">To‘lov so‘rovini yuborish →</button></form><a class="back" href="index.php">← Bosh sahifaga qaytish</a></section></main><script>const cards={click:{number:<?=json_encode($settings['click_card_number']??'')?>,holder:<?=json_encode($settings['click_card_holder']??'')?>},payme:{number:<?=json_encode($settings['payme_card_number']??'')?>,holder:<?=json_encode($settings['payme_card_holder']??'')?>},bank:{number:<?=json_encode($settings['card_number_1']??($settings['card_number']??''))?>,holder:<?=json_encode($settings['card_holder_1']??($settings['card_holder']??''))?>}};const ps=document.getElementById('providerSelect');function showCard(){const c=cards[ps.value]||cards.bank;document.getElementById('cardNumber').textContent=c.number||'Karta raqami administrator tomonidan kiritilmagan';document.getElementById('cardHolder').textContent=c.holder||'';}ps.addEventListener('change',showCard);showCard();const s=document.getElementById('courseSelect'),t=document.getElementById('priceText');function p(){const o=s.options[s.selectedIndex];const n=o&&o.dataset.price!==undefined?Number(o.dataset.price):NaN;t.textContent=Number.isFinite(n)?new Intl.NumberFormat('uz-UZ').format(n)+' so‘m':'—'}s.addEventListener('change',p);p();</script><script src="assets/js/theme.js?v=8"></script></body></html>
